From: workspace-agent <workspace.vm.agent@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 23:15:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 36/57] M3: displacement particles; video textures are not
 fetched

Emitters with a displacement material (type 2) run and draw after the
frame, like displacement meshes: each quad shows the frame copy shifted
along the material's normal map, the shift times the strength layer and
the particle's alpha. They are no longer listed as not drawn.

A layer whose texture is a video (.ogv) is not loaded: the viewer plays
no video, and the path is not in the game storage (404). The layer stays
off and the model lists it as not drawn.

Known defects: displacement particles are not sorted; a video layer draws
nothing in its place.
